5. EVIDENCE STANDARD
Every important engineering statement must be classified as one of:
VERIFIED
Direct evidence demonstrates the claim.
OBSERVED
The behavior was observed but not comprehensively proven.
INFERRED
Reasonably derived from available evidence.
UNKNOWN
There is insufficient evidence.
BLOCKED
A prerequisite prevents safe verification or implementation.
Never convert:
UNKNOWN → VERIFIED
without evidence.
Never convert:
BLOCKED → PASSED
without resolving the blocker.

